# Bundled semgrep rules perun.js.fetch-no-timeout, perun.js.auth-cookie-flags and perun.js.cors-credentials-any-origin: annotated ruleid/ok fictional fixtures (live when semgrep is installed, SKIP otherwise) plus offline checks of the rule text (severity, test-path exclusion, cookie-name, receiver and allowlist-guard regexes, signal and spread exemptions) that still run where semgrep is absent. Cookie receivers: a missing or literal-false httpOnly or secure is reported for res.cookie, reply.setCookie, cookies().set, a variable bound from cookies() and other <x>.cookies.set receivers; for ctx, context, event, this and a bare cookies.set only a literal false is.
